{"_comment":"R3 orchestration config template. Copy to config.json and edit paths only. Pinned versions live in src/router.py (PINNED_VERSIONS); do not override them here. external_calls_enabled (R7-E): external CLI calls (agy, Grok, real Codex) are OFF by default and run only when this is literally true. A missing file, invalid JSON, or any non-true value means OFF. Local handling and the Codex simulated-image path never need this flag; enabling it does not bypass the security gate, the pinned version check, or the separate real-image flag below.","base_dir":"~/muse-multi-agent-orchestration","db_path":"state/tasks.db","executors":{"agy":{"mode":"deny_all","note":"only deny_all or strict; scoped mode is not enforceable (R2-D D-1)"},"codex":{"model":"gpt-6.1-sol","note":"read_boundary is NONE; real image generation is OFF by default (R6-C flag below)","real_image_generation_enabled":false,"sandbox_image":"workspace-write","sandbox_text":"read-only"},"grok":{"default_deny":["Read(*)"],"default_disallowed":["Agent","search_tool","use_tool"],"note":"no zero-tool mode; least-privilege floor is a single tool (R2-D D-2)"}},"external_calls_enabled":false,"limits":{"max_auto_retries":1,"receipt_retention_days":90,"task_timeout_hard_seconds":130},"receipts_root":"state/receipts","work_root":"work"}